      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO BAD DEED (3) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (22.81) there the start prior. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Worth another chance. MR. PRESIDENT (5) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 400m at Warragul, taking a Grade 5 in a speedy 22.73. Top win two back and rates a key player again. FANCY FAYE (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (23.40) at Warragul in a Grade 5. Can hit the frame this time. ZIVA DIVA (4) cannot be ruled out.",
